The deploy failed because `Application.Domain.setMock` has two single-argument overloads, `setMock(fflib_ISObjectDomain)` and `setMock(fflib_IDomain)`. `IOpportunities` inherits from both interface types, so Apex cannot choose between them. Casting the mock to `fflib_ISObjectDomain` gives an exact match and selects that overload. That overload reads the stubbed `sObjectType()`.

